"Do you see how we got there?"

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.386
Um, oh, we --

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.320
I guess yesterday's
"Closer Look"

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.689
gave Trump a hard time

00:00:56.689 --> 00:01:01.394
