00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:04.463
But some of you
pointed out he did

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.532
win the general election
in Iowa three times,

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:08.300
so that maybe
that was what he meant.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.236
And, uh, I apologize.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.305
You know, Mr. Trump,
I owe you one.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.374
And much like
when you owe somebody,

00:01:15.374 --> 00:01:19.045
I'm never going to repay you.

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:22.915
Had a joke about, uh,
they found some cocaine,

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:24.717
you know,
floating in the Caribbean.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:29.055
And the punchline was, people
became suspicious that cocaine

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:32.792
was in the water when all
the fish were flying fish.

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:37.296
Uh, it did better.

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:41.868
But in my defense,
everyone here has seen it.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:45.004
One of the fish in the photo

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.706
I was told was
a largemouth bass,

00:01:47.706 --> 00:01:51.210
which is a freshwater fish that
would not be in the Caribbean.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.245
But once fish hear
there's cocaine in the water,

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:56.415
they'll --

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:59.218
they'll make the trip.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:03.155
Maybe not a largemouth bass,
but you know who loves cocaine?

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.325
Large-nostril bath.

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:06.693
Bass.

00:02:10.362 --> 00:02:13.399
Good news is, I don't think
it would have played any better.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.103
The interesting thing,
you can --

00:02:18.103 --> 00:02:22.174
the way you can tell
a large-nostril bass

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:24.711
isn't from the large nostrils.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:28.081
It has a really long pinky nail.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.352
You know who else loves cocaine?

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:33.753
Blowfish.

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:38.257
Is that a...? I don't think
that's a dad joke.

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:39.725
You know why?

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:42.495
Because to tell your kids,
you'd have to explain cocaine.

00:02:45.631 --> 00:02:46.932
Fish who like cocaine.

00:02:46.932 --> 00:02:50.270
I'm going to stay on this.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.704
I should bail, because I don't
feel like it's been as rich

00:02:52.704 --> 00:02:54.908
an area as I thought.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.545
Fish who like cocaine
are easy to catch,

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:01.146
because when they hear people
are doing lines,

00:03:01.146 --> 00:03:03.149
they swim right over.

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:06.352
But they're --
they're fishing lines.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.625
Hey, we showed what we called,

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.394
