a single fellow cast member

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:29.676
who would agree to
get hit in the nuts.

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:32.010
Oh, Samberg.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.514
A door did not blow
off the Alaska Airlines flight.

00:03:35.514 --> 00:03:37.449
It was a door plug.

00:03:37.449 --> 00:03:45.224
"Plug" isn't a good word
to invoke safety,

00:03:45.224 --> 00:03:48.060
or to evoke safety,
if that's the right word,

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.296
you [bleep] monsters.

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:54.199
"Plug."

00:03:54.199 --> 00:03:55.801
Imagine being on a cruise

00:03:55.801 --> 00:04:00.072
