news. Your room has a plug.

00:04:00.072 --> 00:04:01.774
Try not to jostle it."

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:06.078
Speaking of, I said
Vivek Ramaswamy blows harder

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:08.381
