It would suck.

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:15.654
So apologies to Vivek Ramaswamy.

00:04:15.654 --> 00:04:20.526
You suck harder than the open
door on Alaska Airlines.

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:23.029
I said the weather
in Iowa was below 30.

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:26.532
It was 30 below,
but also 30 below is below 30,

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.635
