yourselves.

00:04:32.337 --> 00:04:34.907
Did a joke about
an Australian teen

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:38.611
whose mom found a snake
in his sock drawer.

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:40.813
The punchline was
the teen speaking,

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.215
