to my Australian accent.

00:04:54.626 --> 00:04:55.928
It was something
I felt good about,

00:04:55.928 --> 00:05:01.100
I felt loose with,
I liked doing on air, but now...

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:05.505
it brings me no joy to do,
and that's on you guys.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:07.373
And the fact that you did
that to me is not

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:08.875
[ Australian accent ] all right.

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:16.549
Hey, we --
